# Endgame Chest for SALE: no Hinekora previews, one bench lock + Caster reforge, then sell
# whatever prefixes it has (as long as the curse is there). NO six-link or colours,
# no Foulborn / armour craft. If the Awakener leaves no open prefix the item cannot get the
# curse ("stuck"); it is then valued at the stuck price below.
include "lib/endgame_chest_parts.craft"

warlord_piece_lean()
hunter_piece()
merge_blind()
curse_reforge()
# (no six-link / omen)

goal has "Warlord: mana cost" elevated and has "Hunter: attack crit" elevated and has "Hunter: additional curse"
sell 16 divine if has "Hunter: additional curse" and has "Warlord: mana cost" elevated and has "Hunter: attack crit" elevated
sell 0 chaos
track "prefixes full after the reforge" prefix_count == 3
